{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12361","headline":"适楚次徐城 · 钱起","name":"适楚次徐城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去家随旅雁，几日到南荆。\n行迈改乡邑，苦辛淹晦明。\n畏途在淫雨，未暮息趋程。\n穷木对秋馆，寒鵶愁古城。\n迷津坐爲客，对酒默含情。\n感激念知己，匣中孤劒鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}